<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="152.4" y="27.94" size="2.54" layer="92">CompactFlash, Status Read Buffer</text>
<text x="116.84" y="142.24" size="2.54" layer="92">JTAG</text>
<text x="125.73" y="99.06" size="1.778" layer="91">status input port</text>
<text x="42.545" y="66.675" size="1.27" layer="91">J3: normally no jumpers installed</text>
<text x="42.545" y="64.135" size="1.27" layer="91">2-3 shorted means switch primary console to VT52</text>
<text x="42.545" y="61.595" size="1.27" layer="91">1-2 shorted prevents FPGA from starting up </text>
<text x="46.99" y="59.69" size="1.27" layer="91">to recover from a bad firmware version</text>
</plain>
